      "fine_trace_step": 20,
      "description": "Root cause. The signed-`inf` tokenizer checks the byte after `inf` with `cursor_[4]` instead of `cursor_[3]`, so an input where `+/-inf` ends exactly at the copied string terminator reads one byte past the initialized parser-visible buffer in `input_json`."
